    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All Living Things</strong> is an animated art-book puzzle game inspired by <i>The Ripley Scroll</i>, a 15th-century alchemical manuscript. Solve 12 intricate visual puzzles, each reflecting a stage in the alchemical process. Select and sequence objects to create looping animations, guided by cryptic verse and symbolic imagery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAND CRAFTED STOP-MOTION ANIMATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All Living Things </i>uses carefully made stop-motion animation for every in-game asset. As you solve puzzles you imbue images with charming animated vitality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/bc4d4eb0b856a0466b81c7feb33ca70d.poster.avif?t=1749557315\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/bc4d4eb0b856a0466b81c7feb33ca70d.webm?t=1749557315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/bc4d4eb0b856a0466b81c7feb33ca70d.mp4?t=1749557315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALLEGORICAL IMAGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter puzzles inspired by real life alchemical emblems and historical visual language. Your journey will be aided by cryptic poems that inspire you to think lyrically and logically!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/1f4b62a0b565e9211239763b79f7a9db.poster.avif?t=1749557315\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/1f4b62a0b565e9211239763b79f7a9db.webm?t=1749557315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/1f4b62a0b565e9211239763b79f7a9db.mp4?t=1749557315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>UNIQUE PUZZLE MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All Living Things </i>introduces a unique visual puzzle mechanic that invites you to carefully observe mystical and natural processes in order to uncover the secrets behind cryptic hermetic emblems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/02addbd94a2d92322034b4ea5b96229d.poster.avif?t=1749557315\" width=632 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/02addbd94a2d92322034b4ea5b96229d.webm?t=1749557315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/02addbd94a2d92322034b4ea5b96229d.mp4?t=1749557315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All Living Things</strong> is an animated art-book puzzle game inspired by <i>The Ripley Scroll</i>, a 15th-century alchemical manuscript. Solve 12 intricate visual puzzles, each reflecting a stage in the alchemical process. Select and sequence objects to create looping animations, guided by cryptic verse and symbolic imagery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAND CRAFTED STOP-MOTION ANIMATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All Living Things </i>uses carefully made stop-motion animation for every in-game asset. As you solve puzzles you imbue images with charming animated vitality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/bc4d4eb0b856a0466b81c7feb33ca70d.poster.avif?t=1749557315\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/bc4d4eb0b856a0466b81c7feb33ca70d.webm?t=1749557315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/bc4d4eb0b856a0466b81c7feb33ca70d.mp4?t=1749557315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALLEGORICAL IMAGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter puzzles inspired by real life alchemical emblems and historical visual language. Your journey will be aided by cryptic poems that inspire you to think lyrically and logically!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/1f4b62a0b565e9211239763b79f7a9db.poster.avif?t=1749557315\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/1f4b62a0b565e9211239763b79f7a9db.webm?t=1749557315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/1f4b62a0b565e9211239763b79f7a9db.mp4?t=1749557315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>UNIQUE PUZZLE MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All Living Things </i>introduces a unique visual puzzle mechanic that invites you to carefully observe mystical and natural processes in order to uncover the secrets behind cryptic hermetic emblems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/02addbd94a2d92322034b4ea5b96229d.poster.avif?t=1749557315\" width=632 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/02addbd94a2d92322034b4ea5b96229d.webm?t=1749557315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/02addbd94a2d92322034b4ea5b96229d.mp4?t=1749557315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
